<title>INDIA: India ITC Q1 97/98 net up 34 pct-paper.</title>
<headline>India ITC Q1 97/98 net up 34 pct-paper.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Indian tobacco major ITC Ltd has reported a 34 percent jump in its net profit for the first quarter ending June 30, 1997, the Business Standard newspaper said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The paper quoted company sources as saying that the 34 percent rise was much higher than the target ITC had set for itself during the first quarter. It did not give details</p>
<p>ITC officials were not immediately available for comment.</p>
<p>-- Bombay equities desk +91-22-265 9000</p>
</text>
